    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the aft pressure bulkhead radial splice, showing the gussets, the stringers, the spar caps and the skin panel splice items around the outer fastener row.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of one radial splice of the aft pressure bulkhead and the skin panel attachment around it. Use it to order splice items after an inspection finding.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows one radial splice looking forward, and the bulkhead carries sixteen splices at equal angular spacing. Sheet 2 shows the section through the outer fastener row, which is the area covered by the repeat inspection. Item 30 is no longer supplied and is shown for identification only; a splice that carries it is brought to the current standard when the splice is next opened."
    },
